    "page.calc.h3.how-it-works.2": "Hur det fungerar",
    "page.calc.p.your-birth-year-month-day-and.2": "Your birth <strong>year, month, day, and hour</strong> each reveal one totem animal guide — your Spiritual, Mental, Emotional, and Physical allies.",
    "page.calc.p.before-calculating-we-convert-your-birth.2": "Before calculating, we convert your birth moment to <strong>Nepal Time</strong> — a shift rooted in the Four Pillars tradition and the spiritual geography of the Buddha’s birthplace. <a href=\"nepal-time.html\">Why Nepal Time?</a>",
    "page.calc.p.after-your-totem-pole-appears-click.2": "After your totem pole appears, <strong>click any animal card</strong> to open a detailed guide about that totem, its element, and its Yin or Yang quality.",
    "page.calc.h4.the-bigger-picture.2": "The bigger picture",
    "page.calc.p.totem-astrology-maps-your-four-guides.2": "Totem Astrology maps your four guides through <strong>Nepal Time</strong>, the <strong>Five Elements</strong>, <strong>Yin &amp; Yang</strong>, <strong>Values Triangles</strong>, and <strong>Sacred Roles</strong> — together they form a language for understanding yourself and others.",
    "page.calc.btn.how-it-works.2": "How It Works",
